`BorderType` is the public border-style enum used by `SkimOptionsBuilder`. Its `None` variant mirrors
`--border=none`; `SkimOptions::build()` normalizes it to `border: None` and enables the shared
`no_border` state so TUI widgets and tmux/zellij popups are all borderless.

